    "quote": "Golden record maintenance requires the company to adhere to data governance frameworks, survivorship and validation rules as set up within a data governance or MDM program. Enforcing these rules across the organization will contribute to continued accuracy, and periodic evaluation and validation of golden records will check for accuracy.",
