    "quote": "ガバナンスを緩めに設定し、特定のユースケース実現に直結するデータ整備のみに集中する",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "成功事例を横展開するタイミングで、全社共通のルールをコーポレート主導で敷いていく",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "The use case is fairly common across",
    "url": "https://community.databricks.com/t5/get-started-discussions/blueprint-entity-resolution-dedup-amp-golden-records-on/td-p/150885",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "--> Each accelerator includes examples of deterministic survivorship rules (recency, completeness, source priority) to pick the best record per cluster.",
    "url": "https://community.databricks.com/t5/get-started-discussions/blueprint-entity-resolution-dedup-amp-golden-records-on/td-p/150885",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "Explore Real-world Case Studies",
    "url": "https://profisee.com/blog/mdm-survivorship/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "Learn how companies like yours leverage the Profisee Platform to achieve business goals in our case study library.",
    "url": "https://profisee.com/blog/mdm-survivorship/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "Source system priority defines a hierarchy of data sources as the most trustworthy for any given attribute. For example, a source system priority rule may declare that the customer contact name attribute should come from the CRM, while supply chain management software provides location information for all vendors.",
    "url": "https://profisee.com/blog/mdm-survivorship/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "Some examples of conditional rules include populating different tax numbers based on location or even different data sources for different business sizes. Conditional rules can also extend to business processes by relying on procurement data for the first 90 days the customer is active and then switching to a recency-based rule as the customer and their data populate to more systems.",
    "url": "https://profisee.com/blog/mdm-survivorship/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "MDM Golden Record: Use Cases, Customer 360 & Best Practices",
    "url": "https://www.latentview.com/blog/mdm-golden-record/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "Golden Record in MDM: How It Works, Examples & Best Practices",
    "url": "https://www.latentview.com/blog/mdm-golden-record/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "Golden Record Use Cases Across Industries",
    "url": "https://www.latentview.com/blog/mdm-golden-record/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "AI also reduces the burden on data stewards by handling a greater proportion of match and merge decisions automatically, surfacing only the genuinely ambiguous cases for human review. Over time, as models learn from steward decisions, the proportion of records requiring manual intervention decreases.",
    "url": "https://www.latentview.com/blog/mdm-golden-record/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   }
  ],
  "失敗・落とし穴": [
   {
    "quote": ": 何がダメかだけではなく、どうすれば安全に使えるかの道筋を示す",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "各国の商習慣や法規制（GDPR等）が異なるため、ローカルの取引データまでグローバルで統一しようとすると失敗しやすい",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "運用にあたっての、推奨や注意点は以下の通り",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "データカタログの「最終更新日」という表記には注意が必要である",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "高機能なツールは運用に乗せるまでの設定が重く、立ち上げ期にはオーバースペックとなり「導入しただけで使われない」失敗に陥りやすい",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "テストに失敗した場合は、不完全なデータを下流のダッシュボードへ連携させないようパイプラインを自動停止させ、品質低下を未然に防ぐ",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "トレンドに振り回されないように注意すること",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "事実の正しさに加え、データのバイアスの監視や、AIが処理しやすいデータ分布・形式への変換精度の担保",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "生成AIサービスの利用に関する注意喚起（個人情報保護委員会）",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "AIの回答精度やバイアスを定期モニタリングし、源泉データの不備をカタログへフィードバックする",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   }
  ],
  "一次情報の探し方": [
   {
    "quote": ": 顧客から預かったデータや、特定の目的で契約・購入した外部データ（SaaSの統計情報や外部調査データなど）を、元の契約範囲を超えて二次利用したり、別プロジェクトに流用したりすることを禁止する",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": ": 分析目的であっても、個人を特定できる情報（氏名、詳細な住所等）をそのまま扱うことは原則禁止とし、適切なマスキングや統計化処理を必須とする",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "非構造化データ（テキスト文書、メール、議事録、PDF等）は、個人情報がテキスト中の任意の箇所に出現し得るため、同じアプローチでは対応できない",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "顧客から受領したPDFをデータ基盤に連携したい",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "ガバナンスチーム自らが、カタログの利用ログやメタデータの統計情報を集計し、それを元にアクションを提示することで、データ駆動組織としてあるべき背中を見せる必要がある",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "カタログの利用ログやメタデータの統計情報を集計し、ダッシュボード化して公開する",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "このタイムラグがビジネス上許容できるかを事前に定義し、リアルタイム性が不可欠な場合は、データ基盤を経由しない「基幹系同士の直接連携」を採用する方針とする",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "3の帰結として、具体的な技術トレンド（データメッシュアーキテクチャ）を採用する",
    "url": "https://future-architect.github.io/arch-guidelines/documents/forDataGovernance/data_governance_guidelines.html",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   },
   {
    "quote": "Before writing survivorship rules or configuring matching logic, conduct a thorough data profiling exercise across all source systems. Understand the actual quality, completeness, and reliability of each field in each system. Rules designed without this knowledge are guesses. Rules designed with it are grounded in evidence.",
    "url": "https://www.latentview.com/blog/mdm-golden-record/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-09"
   }
  ]
